\begin{equation}\label{eq:hf-rank}
\operatorname{rk} HF(Y)\geq \operatorname{rk} HF(Z),
\tag{6}
\end{equation}
where $HF$ is the $\widehat{HF}$ or $HF_{\mathrm{red}}$ version of Heegaard Floer homology?
